  "helpFaqQ1": "What is the 5-task cap?",
  "helpFaqA1": "You can add up to 5 tasks per local day. The 6th is blocked on purpose — discipline beats overload. The cap is the feature, not a limitation.",
  "helpFaqQ2": "What happens at midnight?",
  "helpFaqA2": "At your local midnight, any task still marked open is stamped \"missed\" and moves to Left Behind. Habit streaks reset if the habit was not completed the day before.",
  "helpFaqQ3": "What is Left Behind?",
  "helpFaqA3": "A gentle, dismissible list of tasks you didn't finish. Open it, re-add only what still matters, and let the rest go. Free tier sees the last 7 days; Pro sees full history.",
  "helpFaqQ4": "How do streaks work?",
  "helpFaqA4": "A day extends the chain when you had at least 1 task and 0 were missed. Days with zero tasks neither extend nor break the chain. A streak freeze forgives one missed day per month.",
  "helpFaqQ5": "What is the streak freeze?",
  "helpFaqA5": "One \"freeze\" per calendar month, Pro only. Spend it on a day you missed to keep your chain alive. Find it on the Progress tab.",
  "helpFaqQ6": "Where is my data stored?",
